{"seq":1,"slug":"3d-asset-sku-bind-qc","title":"3D/AR 资产与 SKU 绑定及入库质检","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/asset-sku-serving/3d-asset-sku-bind-qc","wordCount":2057,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"3d-ar-资产与-sku-绑定及入库质检\">3D/AR 资产与 SKU 绑定及入库质检</h1><p>一件商品有 12 个颜色 × 6 个尺码 = 72 个 SKU，3D 模型只有 12 份（按颜色），AR 试穿模型只有 6 份（按尺码）。资产和 SKU 不是一对一，也不是一对多，而是<strong>多对多的组合关系</strong>——这是资产服务层最容易设计错的地方，一旦建模成像图片那样的「SKU 挂一份媒体」，后面所有的缓存、失效、变体切换都会变得别扭。本篇讲清资产的标识、绑定模型与入库质检；资产怎么加载与降级见 <a href=\"3d-asset-cdn-loading\">模型多端加载与渐进式渲染</a> 与 <a href=\"edge-cloud-render-fallback\">端/云渲染与性能降级</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"资产是独立的实体-不是-sku-的属性\">资产是独立的实体，不是 SKU 的属性</h3><p>把 3D 模型当作 SKU 的一个字段（像 <code>image_url</code> 那样）会导致三个具体问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同一模型在多个 SKU 间重复上传</strong>——12 个颜色如果各自上传一份完整的模型，存储与 CDN 成本乘 12。</li>\n<li><strong>无法表达「几何相同、材质不同」</strong>——同一款鞋的配色差异只是材质不同，几何完全一致；<code>KHR_materials_variants</code> 正是为这种场景设计的（见 <a href=\"../3d-asset-production-spec/gltf-usdz-material-spec\">容器、材质与精度规格</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>失效粒度错误</strong>——改一次模型需要更新 72 个 SKU 记录，而不是一条资产记录。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>正确的模型是<strong>资产实体 + 绑定表</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Asset&lt;br/&gt;几何+材质母版] --&gt; B[AssetRevision&lt;br/&gt;版本化的产物]&#10;  B --&gt; C[AssetVariant&lt;br/&gt;LOD0/LOD1/LOD2&lt;br/&gt;GLB/USDZ]&#10;  B --&gt; D[VariantBinding&lt;br/&gt;材质变体映射]&#10;  E[Sku] --&gt; F[AssetBinding]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{绑定类型}&#10;  G --&gt;|by_geometry| H[整个 SKU 用同一资产&lt;br/&gt;差异在材质变体]&#10;  G --&gt;|by_size| I[按尺码选不同资产&lt;br/&gt;试穿模型]&#10;  G --&gt;|by_option| J[按选项组合选资产&lt;br/&gt;颜色+尺寸矩阵]&#10;  F --&gt; K[发布校验]&#10;  K --&gt;|通过| L[CDN 分发]&#10;  K --&gt;|拒绝| M[退回生产]\">graph TD\n  A[Asset&lt;br/&gt;几何+材质母版] --&gt; B[AssetRevision&lt;br/&gt;版本化的产物]\n  B --&gt; C[AssetVariant&lt;br/&gt;LOD0/LOD1/LOD2&lt;br/&gt;GLB/USDZ]\n  B --&gt; D[VariantBinding&lt;br/&gt;材质变体映射]\n  E[Sku] --&gt; F[AssetBinding]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{绑定类型}\n  G --&gt;|by_geometry| H[整个 SKU 用同一资产&lt;br/&gt;差异在材质变体]\n  G --&gt;|by_size| I[按尺码选不同资产&lt;br/&gt;试穿模型]\n  G --&gt;|by_option| J[按选项组合选资产&lt;br/&gt;颜色+尺寸矩阵]\n  F --&gt; K[发布校验]\n  K --&gt;|通过| L[CDN 分发]\n  K --&gt;|拒绝| M[退回生产]</pre><h3 id=\"资产标识的稳定性\">资产标识的稳定性</h3><p>资产 ID 是整套系统的外键，它必须满足三个性质：<strong>唯一、稳定、可读性无关</strong>。用文件名当 ID 是最常见的错误——文件名会随重命名变化，而 CDN 路径、客户端缓存、埋点数据都引用它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;assetId&quot;: &quot;ast_7f3c9e21&quot;,&#10;  &quot;skuBindingKey&quot;: &quot;brand-a-sneaker-2026#color=midnight-black&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;ar_tryon&quot;,&#10;  &quot;revision&quot;: 4,&#10;  &quot;updatedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-09-20T11:04:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;produces&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;format&quot;: &quot;glb&quot;, &quot;lod&quot;: 0, &quot;bytes&quot;: 2411520, &quot;sha256&quot;: &quot;9a1c...&quot;, &quot;path&quot;: &quot;c/ast_7f3c9e21/r4/lod0.glb&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;format&quot;: &quot;glb&quot;, &quot;lod&quot;: 1, &quot;bytes&quot;: 812034, &quot;sha256&quot;: &quot;4e77...&quot;, &quot;path&quot;: &quot;c/ast_7f3c9e21/r4/lod1.glb&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;format&quot;: &quot;usdz&quot;, &quot;lod&quot;: 0, &quot;bytes&quot;: 3877120, &quot;sha256&quot;: &quot;b201...&quot;, &quot;path&quot;: &quot;c/ast_7f3c9e21/r4/lod0.usdz&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;specs&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;meter&quot;,&#10;    &quot;originPolicy&quot;: &quot;bottom-center&quot;,&#10;    &quot;upAxis&quot;: &quot;+Y&quot;,&#10;    &quot;frontAxis&quot;: &quot;+Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;extensionsRequired&quot;: [&quot;KHR_mesh_quantization&quot;],&#10;    &quot;extensionsUsed&quot;: [&quot;KHR_materials_variants&quot;, &quot;KHR_texture_basisu&quot;, &quot;EXT_meshopt_compression&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assetId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ast_7f3c9e21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"skuBindingKey\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brand-a-sneaker-2026#color=midnight-black\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ar_tryon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"revision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"updatedAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-20T11:04:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"produces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"glb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2411520</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sha256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9a1c...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c/ast_7f3c9e21/r4/lod0.glb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"glb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">812034</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sha256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4e77...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c/ast_7f3c9e21/r4/lod1.glb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usdz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3877120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sha256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b201...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c/ast_7f3c9e21/r4/lod0.usdz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"specs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"meter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"originPolicy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bottom-center\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"upAxis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"+Y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"frontAxis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"+Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"extensionsRequired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KHR_mesh_quantization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"extensionsUsed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KHR_materials_variants\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KHR_texture_basisu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXT_meshopt_compression\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>skuBindingKey</code> 用「产品标识 + 维度选择器」的形式，是为了让绑定关系在没有 SKU 主数据时也能表达。这样做的额外好处是：当 SKU 被重建或换编码体系时，资产绑定不受影响。SKU 主数据体系的细节属于商品主数据域，不在本 hub 范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"绑定模型\">绑定模型</h2><h3 id=\"三种绑定粒度\">三种绑定粒度</h3><p>绑定关系不是「SKU → 资产」的一条边，而是带类型的边，因为不同类型的资产以不同维度共享：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>绑定类型</th>\n<th>资产在哪些 SKU 间共享</th>\n<th>典型资产</th>\n<th>绑定键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>by_geometry</code></td>\n<td>所有几何相同的 SKU，差异走材质变体</td>\n<td>展示模型（鞋、包）</td>\n<td>产品 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>by_size</code></td>\n<td>每个尺码一份（试穿需要不同尺寸）</td>\n<td>服装/鞋试穿模型</td>\n<td>产品 ID + 尺码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>by_option</code></td>\n<td>每个选项组合一份（如颜色 × 材质）</td>\n<td>定制家具</td>\n<td>产品 ID + 选项组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>by_geometry</code> 是最高效的：12 个颜色共享一份几何，材质通过 <code>KHR_materials_variants</code> 的变体索引切换，资产总量从 O(颜色数) 降到 O(1)。它的前提是配色差异<strong>只体现在材质上</strong>——如果不同配色还有结构差异（比如黑色款是金属扣、米色款是布扣），就必须升格为 <code>by_option</code>。</p>\n<p><code>by_size</code> 的资产量是 O(尺码数)，这是试穿类资产的固有成本，见 <a href=\"../ar-tryon-size/apparel-shoe-fit-tryon\">服装与鞋的虚拟试穿</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"绑定表的结构与查询\">绑定表的结构与查询</h3><p>绑定表要支持两种查询：给定 SKU 找资产（前台渲染路径），以及给定资产找受影响的 SKU（失效与重建路径）。后者常被忽略，而它决定了发布流程能否做级联失效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE asset (&#10;  asset_id      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku_bind_key  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  asset_type    TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (asset_type IN&#10;                  (&#39;display_3d&#39;,&#39;ar_tryon&#39;,&#39;ar_placement&#39;,&#39;ar_face&#39;)),&#10;  revision      INT  NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (state IN (&#39;draft&#39;,&#39;qc&#39;,&#39;published&#39;,&#39;retired&#39;)),&#10;  specs         JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  updated_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE asset_binding (&#10;  sku_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  asset_id     TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES asset(asset_id),&#10;  binding_kind TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (binding_kind IN (&#39;by_geometry&#39;,&#39;by_size&#39;,&#39;by_option&#39;)),&#10;  selector     JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  variant_index INT,&#10;  priority     INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (sku_id, asset_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 前台路径：给定 SKU 取优先级最高的已发布资产&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_binding_lookup ON asset_binding (sku_id, priority DESC);&#10;&#10;-- 失效路径：给定资产反查所有受影响 SKU&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_binding_reverse ON asset_binding (asset_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> asset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_bind_key  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (asset_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'display_3d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ar_tryon'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ar_placement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ar_face'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revision      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'draft'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'qc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'published'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  specs         JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> asset_binding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset(asset_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  binding_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (binding_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'by_geometry'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'by_size'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'by_option'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  selector     JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variant_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, asset_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 前台路径：给定 SKU 取优先级最高的已发布资产</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_binding_lookup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_binding (sku_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">priority DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 失效路径：给定资产反查所有受影响 SKU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_binding_reverse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_binding (asset_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>selector</code> 用 JSONB 存维度选择器（如 <code>{&quot;size&quot;:&quot;M&quot;}</code>），<code>variant_index</code> 直接对应 <code>KHR_materials_variants</code> 里的变体下标。这样前台拿到绑定后，不需要额外查询就能知道「该用哪个变体渲染」。把变体下标放在绑定表而不是资产 specs 里，是因为它是<strong>绑定关系的属性</strong>而不是资产的属性——同一份资产被不同 SKU 绑定，激活的变体不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"绑定发布是原子操作\">绑定发布是原子操作</h3><p>一条 SKU 从「有 3D」变成「没有 3D」比反过来更危险：商品页的渲染逻辑通常会假设「有绑定就渲染查看器」，而资产在 QC 阶段被退回或下线时，绑定如果没有同步清理，商品页会出现空白查看器或加载失败。</p>\n<p>发布必须是跨表的事务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;&#10;-- 1. 断言资产处于 qc 状态且质检通过&#10;UPDATE asset&#10;   SET state = &#39;published&#39;, revision = revision + 1, updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE asset_id = $1 AND state = &#39;qc&#39;&#10; RETURNING revision;&#10;&#10;-- 2. 没有任何行被更新 -&gt; 质检未通过或已被并发发布，回滚&#10;--    (应用层检查 affected_rows，为 0 则 ROLLBACK)&#10;&#10;-- 3. 写入/刷新绑定&#10;INSERT INTO asset_binding (sku_id, asset_id, binding_kind, selector, variant_index, priority)&#10;VALUES ($2, $1, $3, $4::jsonb, $5, 100)&#10;ON CONFLICT (sku_id, asset_id)&#10;DO UPDATE SET selector = EXCLUDED.selector,&#10;              variant_index = EXCLUDED.variant_index,&#10;              priority = EXCLUDED.priority;&#10;&#10;-- 4. 失效缓存与派生索引（同事务写 outbox，由消费者异步执行）&#10;INSERT INTO outbox (topic, payload)&#10;VALUES (&#39;asset.published&#39;, jsonb_build_object(&#39;asset_id&#39;, $1, &#39;revision&#39;, $6));&#10;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1. 断言资产处于 qc 状态且质检通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'published'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, revision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'qc'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RETURNING revision;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2. 没有任何行被更新 -> 质检未通过或已被并发发布，回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--    (应用层检查 affected_rows，为 0 则 ROLLBACK)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3. 写入/刷新绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_binding (sku_id, asset_id, binding_kind, selector, variant_index, priority)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (sku_id, asset_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DO </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              variant_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">variant_index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              priority </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 4. 失效缓存与派生索引（同事务写 outbox，由消费者异步执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbox (topic, payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'asset.published'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, jsonb_build_object(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'asset_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'revision'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 4 步用 <strong>outbox 模式</strong>而不是直接调 CDN 失效 API，是因为外部调用不能参与数据库事务。outbox 记录与业务写入同事务提交，消费者读到后重试失效，保证「发布成功但缓存没失效」这种不一致不会永久存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"入库质检\">入库质检</h2><h3 id=\"质检的四个维度\">质检的四个维度</h3><p>资产从生产到上线要过四道检查，每一道的失败都是可检出的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>工具/手段</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>结构</strong></td>\n<td>GLB 容器合法性、JSON schema、accessor 有效性、<code>NaN</code>/非法四元数/不可分解矩阵</td>\n<td>glTF-Validator</td>\n<td>加载失败或渲染错乱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>规格</strong></td>\n<td>单位、原点、朝向、命名规范、扩展声明</td>\n<td>自建校验器</td>\n<td>AR 尺寸错、路径大小写 404</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>尺寸</strong></td>\n<td>包围盒与主数据实测尺寸的偏差</td>\n<td>与商品尺寸字段比对</td>\n<td>用户基于错误尺寸下单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>视觉</strong></td>\n<td>空洞、接缝、色差、法线错误</td>\n<td>渲染多视角快照 + 人工/模型审核</td>\n<td>观感不达标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>glTF-Validator 是结构检查的基准工具：它校验 JSON 语法与 GLBv2 容器正确性、JSON schema 属性与类型、内部引用有效性、Data URI 编码；检测 accessor 中的 <code>NaN</code>、非法四元数、不可分解矩阵；校验 <code>accessor.min</code>/<code>accessor.max</code>、sparse accessor 编码与动画输入输出；对贴图给出<strong>非 2 的幂尺寸的警告</strong>以及动画、自定义色彩空间等不支持特性的警告。它对 <code>KHR_materials_variants</code>、<code>KHR_mesh_quantization</code>、<code>KHR_texture_transform</code>、<code>KHR_materials_specular</code> 等扩展有显式校验支持（<a href=\"https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Validator\">glTF-Validator</a>）。</p>\n<p>它<strong>只报 Error 与 Warning 两个级别</strong>，且返回码非零的条件是「至少发现一个 error」。这个语义很关键：质检管线应当把 <strong>error 视为硬阻断、warning 视为需人工确认</strong>，而不是笼统地「有问题就拒绝」——非 2 的幂贴图是警告，但商品资产用了非 2 的幂贴图往往是有意为之（比如长条形的包装盒贴图）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规格校验器要自定义\">规格校验器要自定义</h3><p>glTF-Validator 检查的是格式合法性，不检查你的业务约定。单位是不是米、原点是不是在底面中心，这些必须自建校验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 业务规格校验：glTF-Validator 不覆盖，必须自建&#10;def check_specs(asset, product_master):&#10;    errors = []&#10;&#10;    # 1. 尺度：包围盒最长边应与主数据尺寸一致（容差 2%）&#10;    bb = asset.bounding_box&#10;    expected = max(product_master.dimensions)       # 单位：米&#10;    if abs(bb.longest_edge - expected) / expected &gt; 0.02:&#10;        errors.append(f&quot;scale_drift: {bb.longest_edge:.3f} vs {expected:.3f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    # 2. 原点：包围盒底面中心应接近 (0, 0, 0)&#10;    if abs(bb.center_x) &gt; 0.005 or abs(bb.min_y) &gt; 0.005 or abs(bb.center_z) &gt; 0.005:&#10;        errors.append(f&quot;origin_offset: center=({bb.center_x:.4f},{bb.center_z:.4f}) miny={bb.min_y:.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    # 3. 扩展声明一致性：Required 的扩展必须在 Required 里且无回退&#10;    for ext in asset.specs[&quot;extensionsRequired&quot;]:&#10;        if not has_fallback(asset, ext):&#10;            errors.append(f&quot;required_without_fallback: {ext}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    # 4. 文件命名规范：a-z 0-9 _ - ，字母打头&#10;    for f in asset.files:&#10;        if not re.fullmatch(r&quot;[a-z][a-z0-9_-]*\\.[a-z0-9]+&quot;, f.basename):&#10;            errors.append(f&quot;bad_filename: {f.basename}&quot;)&#10;&#10;    return errors\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 业务规格校验：glTF-Validator 不覆盖，必须自建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_specs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(asset, product_master):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    errors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. 尺度：包围盒最长边应与主数据尺寸一致（容差 2%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset.bounding_box</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product_master.dimensions)       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 单位：米</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bb.longest_edge </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        errors.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scale_drift: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bb.longest_edge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vs </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. 原点：包围盒底面中心应接近 (0, 0, 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bb.center_x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.005</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bb.min_y) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.005</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bb.center_z) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.005</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        errors.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"origin_offset: center=(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bb.center_x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bb.center_z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) miny=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bb.min_y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 扩展声明一致性：Required 的扩展必须在 Required 里且无回退</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ext </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset.specs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"extensionsRequired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_fallback(asset, ext):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            errors.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"required_without_fallback: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ext</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 4. 文件命名规范：a-z 0-9 _ - ，字母打头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset.files:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re.fullmatch(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z][a-z0-9_-]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z0-9]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, f.basename):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            errors.append(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bad_filename: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">f.basename</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errors</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 3 条检查的是扩展声明的自洽性：一个扩展进了 <code>extensionsRequired</code> 却没有回退路径，意味着不支持它的设备会直接加载失败。这是有意的兼容性策略还是遗漏，机器判断不了，所以它应该产出<strong>需要人工确认的警告</strong>而不是阻断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质检门与状态机\">质检门与状态机</h3><p>资产状态机是整个发布流程的骨架：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; draft : 生产完成,登记资产&#10;  draft --&gt; qc : 提交质检&#10;  qc --&gt; published : 结构+规格+尺寸+视觉 全通过&#10;  qc --&gt; draft : 有阻断项,退回返工&#10;  published --&gt; retired : 商品下架 / 资产被替换&#10;  published --&gt; published : 新 revision 重新走 qc&#10;  retired --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; draft : 生产完成,登记资产\n  draft --&gt; qc : 提交质检\n  qc --&gt; published : 结构+规格+尺寸+视觉 全通过\n  qc --&gt; draft : 有阻断项,退回返工\n  published --&gt; retired : 商品下架 / 资产被替换\n  published --&gt; published : 新 revision 重新走 qc\n  retired --&gt; [*]</pre><p>把「重新生成一个 revision」表达为 <code>published → published</code> 的自环而不是 <code>published → draft</code>，是为了区分两件事：<strong>内容修正</strong>（需要重新质检）与<strong>商品状态变化</strong>（不需要）。这个区分让商品下架不会触发无意义的质检队列，也让内容修正不会短暂地把线上资产置为不可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>资产是独立实体，不是 SKU 的属性字段；<code>asset</code> 表 + <code>asset_binding</code> 表的多对多结构才能表达「12 色 6 码共享少量资产」。</li>\n<li>绑定有 <code>by_geometry</code>（配色差异走材质变体，资产量 O(1)）、<code>by_size</code>（试穿模型按尺码，O(尺码数)）、<code>by_option</code>（选项组合决定结构，O(组合数)）三种粒度。</li>\n<li>绑定表必须同时支持正向查询（SKU → 资产）与反向查询（资产 → 受影响 SKU），后者是级联失效的前提，容易被忽略。</li>\n<li><code>variant_index</code> 是绑定关系的属性而不是资产的属性：同一资产被不同 SKU 绑定时激活的变体不同。</li>\n<li>发布必须跨表事务 + outbox 模式，让缓存失效这类外部调用在事务提交后可靠重试。</li>\n<li>入库质检四维度：结构（glTF-Validator，Error 硬阻断、Warning 需确认）、规格（自建校验器：单位/原点/扩展自洽/命名）、尺寸（包围盒与主数据比对，2% 容差）、视觉（多视角快照审核）。</li>\n<li>资产状态机把「内容修正」与「商品状态变化」区分开，避免下架触发无意义质检、修正导致线上短暂不可用。</li>\n<li>已发布资产的加载与降级策略见 <a href=\"3d-asset-cdn-loading\">模型多端加载与渐进式渲染</a>；覆盖哪些品类先做，见 <a href=\"../ar-conversion-ops/ar-asset-coverage-priority\">3D/AR 覆盖品类优先级</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"3D/AR 资产与 SKU 绑定及入库质检","id":"3d-ar-资产与-sku-绑定及入库质检"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"资产是独立的实体，不是 SKU 的属性","id":"资产是独立的实体-不是-sku-的属性"},{"level":3,"text":"资产标识的稳定性","id":"资产标识的稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"绑定模型","id":"绑定模型"},{"level":3,"text":"三种绑定粒度","id":"三种绑定粒度"},{"level":3,"text":"绑定表的结构与查询","id":"绑定表的结构与查询"},{"level":3,"text":"绑定发布是原子操作","id":"绑定发布是原子操作"},{"level":2,"text":"入库质检","id":"入库质检"},{"level":3,"text":"质检的四个维度","id":"质检的四个维度"},{"level":3,"text":"规格校验器要自定义","id":"规格校验器要自定义"},{"level":3,"text":"质检门与状态机","id":"质检门与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"家具摆放与眼镜美妆 AR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/ar-tryon-size/furniture-placement-beauty"},"next":{"title":"端/云渲染与性能降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/asset-sku-serving/edge-cloud-render-fallback"}}